        526.6085205078125,
        67.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "and should be evaluated for TB and other diseases that cause such symptoms.  (Strong recommendation,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        68.58299255371094,
        299.06341552734375,
        81.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "moderate-quality evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-BookItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        88.24297332763672,
        526.6936645507812,
        101.04297637939453
      ],
      "text": "Infants and children living with HIV who have poor weight gain, fever or current cough or who have a history",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        102.24297332763672,
        526.6884155273438,
        115.04297637939453
      ],
      "text": "of contact with a case of TB should be evaluated for TB and other diseases that cause such symptoms. If",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        116.24297332763672,
        526.7064208984375,
        129.04296875
      ],
      "text": "the evaluation shows no TB, these children should be offered preventive treatment, regardless of their age.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        130.2529754638672,
        377.4024658203125,
        143.04296875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low-quality evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-BookItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        149.9129638671875,
        526.5963745117188,
        162.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "The absence of any symptoms of TB and the absence of abnormal chest radiographic findings may be",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        163.9129638671875,
        526.6806640625,
        177.02296447753906
      ],
      "text": "used to rule out active TB disease among HIV-negative household contacts aged   5 years and other  ≥",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.9029541015625,
        526.4273681640625,
        190.81295776367188
      ],
      "text": "New  at-risk groups before preventive treatment.  (Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence.",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        191.9029541015625,
        158.30938720703125,
        204.81295776367188
      ],
      "text": "recommendation )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.8704833984375,
        171.2286834716797,
        236.6534881591797
      ],
      "text": "C. Testing for LTBI",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        242.58880615234375,
        526.6404418945312,
        255.3887939453125
      ],
      "text": "Either a tuberculin skin test (TST) or interferon-gamma release assay (IGRA) can be used to test for LTBI.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        256.57879638671875,
        384.30609130859375,
        269.4888000488281
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation (Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03608703613281,
        276.2587890625,
        526.71728515625,
        289.05877685546875
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV who have a positive test for LTBI benefit more from preventive treatment than those",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03608703613281,
        290.2587890625,
        526.5422973632812,
        303.05877685546875
      ],
      "text": "who have a negative LTBI test; LTBI testing can be used, where feasible, to identify such individuals.  (Strong",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03608703613281,
        304.268798828125,
        347.8410949707031,
        317.05877685546875
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, high-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-BookItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03608703613281,
        323.9288024902344,
        526.6639404296875,
        336.7287902832031
      ],
      "text": "LTBI testing by TST or IGRA is not a requirement for initiating preventive treatment in people living with",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03608703613281,
        337.9288024902344,
        526.5732421875,
        350.7287902832031
      ],
      "text": "HIV or child household contacts aged < 5 years.  (Strong recommendation, moderate-quality evidence. Updated",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03608703613281,
        351.93878173828125,
        154.78907775878906,
        364.7287902832031
      ],
      "text": "recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-BookItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.8861999511719,
        232.85911560058594,
        396.6692199707031
      ],
      "text": "D. Treatment options for LTBI",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        402.6045227050781,
        526.6641845703125,
        415.4045104980469
      ],
      "text": "Isoniazid monotherapy for 6 months is recommended for treatment of LTBI in both adults and children",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        416.6045227050781,
        526.5131225585938,
        429.4045104980469
      ],
      "text": "in countries with high and low TB incidence.  (Strong recommendation, high-quality evidence. Existing",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        430.614501953125,
        156.9490966796875,
        443.4045104980469
      ],
      "text": "recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-BookItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        450.2745361328125,
        526.658203125,
        463.07452392578125
      ],
      "text": "Rifampicin plus isoniazid daily for 3 months should be offered as an alternative to 6 months of isoniazid",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        464.2745361328125,
        526.688232421875,
        477.07452392578125
      ],
      "text": "monotherapy as preventive treatment for children and adolescents aged < 15 years in countries with a high",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        478.2645263671875,
        423.6661071777344,
        491.1745300292969
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation TB incidence.  (Strong recommendation, low-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        497.9445495605469,
        526.6533813476562,
        510.7445373535156
      ],
      "text": "Rifapentine and isoniazid weekly for 3 months may be offered as an alternative to 6 months of isoniazid",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        511.944580078125,
        526.6470947265625,
        524.7445678710938
      ],
      "text": "monotherapy as preventive treatment for both adults and children in countries with a high TB incidence.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        525.9345703125,
        407.80609130859375,
        538.8446044921875
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation (Conditional recommendation, moderate-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        545.6145629882812,
        526.7112426757812,
        558.41455078125
      ],
      "text": "The following options are recommended for treatment of LTBI in countries with a low TB incidence as",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        559.6145629882812,
        526.6773071289062,
        572.41455078125
      ],
      "text": "alternatives to 6 months of isoniazid monotherapy: 9 months of isoniazid, or a 3-month regimen of weekly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        573.6145629882812,
        526.6731567382812,
        586.41455078125
      ],
      "text": "rifapentine plus isoniazid, or 3–4 months of isoniazid plus rifampicin, or 3–4 months of rifampicin alone.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        587.6245727539062,
        419.05523681640625,
        600.41455078125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate–high-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-BookItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        607.2845458984375,
        526.7072143554688,
        620.0845336914062
      ],
      "text": "In settings with high TB incidence and transmission, adults and adolescents living with HIV who have an",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        621.2845458984375,
        526.6741333007812,
        634.0845336914062
      ],
      "text": "unknown or a positive TST and are unlikely to have active TB disease should receive at least 36 months of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        635.2845458984375,
        526.63427734375,
        648.0845336914062
      ],
      "text": "IPT, regardless of whether they are receiving ART. IPT should also be given irrespective of the degree of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        649.2845458984375,
        524.4053955078125,
        662.0845336914062
      ],
      "text": "immunosuppression, history of previous TB treatment and pregnancy.  (Conditional recommendation, low-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.02610778808594,
        663.2845458984375,
        258.8861083984375,
        676.0845336914062
      ],
      "text": ".  quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.2405395507812,
        485.747802734375,
        708.0235595703125
      ],
      "text": "E. Preventive treatment for contacts of patients with multidrug-resistant-TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        713.9588012695312,
        526.6560668945312,
        726.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "In selected high-risk household contacts of patients with multidrug-resistant tuberculosis, preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        727.9588012695312,
        526.624267578125,
        740.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "treatment may be considered based on individualised risk assessment and a sound clinical justification.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03610229492188,
        741.9487915039062,
        402.92608642578125,
        754.8588256835938
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation (Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        547.0786743164062,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "3",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
